---
// Emergency disclaimer banner for diagnostic landing pages
// Displayed at the top of high-intent medical pages for patient safety and liability
---

<div class="bg-red-50 border-b border-red-200">
  <div class="container-site py-2.5 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-center">
    <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-red-600 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" />
    </svg>
    <p class="text-xs font-sans text-red-800 leading-snug">
      <strong>Medical emergency? Call <a href="tel:911" class="underline font-bold">911</a> or visit your nearest ER.</strong> This is a non-emergency diagnostic service.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
